Um, you said Mac OSX. That *isn't* *nix. Close, but doesn't qualify. Not
POSIX compliant enough. That's why theres different directories under
/sys. The aforementioned file goes in the same directory as the nethack
executable, in other words in one directory up from the "lib" directory
where the temporary files and the "map" files for nethack are kept. I 
recommend getting the source - for no other reason than to be able to read
that whole file, I just gave a fraction and more of it talks about your
defaults file. It comes as a tar gzipped file from the above nethack site.
You might also try the nethack wiki although I've found finding anything
technical there somewhat difficult. 

